real money to work. The S&amp;P 500 closed at 7,708, up 0.2%. The NASDAQ composite finished at 26,331, also up 0.2%. The TSX composite ended at 36,402, up 0.1%. July FOMC Minutes showed a marginally less hawkish tone with three dissenters noted and references to AI rising from six

